flowchart TD
    A[Incoming API Gateway Request] --> B[Request Context Builder]
    B --> C[Authorization Header Extractor]
    C --> D[JWT Decode]
    D --> E[Scope Parser]
    E --> F{FHIR Scope Allowed?}

    F -- No --> G[Build OperationOutcome]
    G --> H[Return 403 application/fhir+json]

    F -- Yes --> I[Resolve Tenant Id / Client Id]
    I --> J[Run Request Validator]
    J --> K{Valid Request?}

    K -- No --> L[Build OperationOutcome]
    L --> M[Return 400 application/fhir+json]

    K -- Yes --> N[Invoke Domain Handler]
    N --> O[Fetch Domain Data]
    O --> P[Return Canonical Model]

    P --> Q[Transformation Service]
    Q --> R[Mapping Resolver]
    R --> S[Base Mapping Registry]
    R --> T[Client Override Registry]

    S --> U[Resolved Mapping]
    T --> U

    U --> V[Generic Mapper / Typed Adapter]
    V --> W[Terminology Normalizer]
    W --> X[FHIR Validator]

    X --> Y{FHIR Valid?}

    Y -- No --> Z[Build OperationOutcome]
    Z --> AA[Return 422 application/fhir+json]

    Y -- Yes --> AB{Single Resource or Collection?}
    AB -- Single --> AC[Return Patient / Resource]
    AB -- Collection --> AD[Build Bundle searchset]

    AC --> AE[Raw FHIR Response Writer]
    AD --> AE
    AE --> AF[HTTP Response application/fhir+json]
